{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:14:04+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Idle Wizard", "steam_appid": 992070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4848150, 4181890, 3939820, 3856390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever dreamt of being a Wizard?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then try out Idle Wizard! It's an idle game infused with RPG elements, centered around becoming the most powerful wizard the world ever knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/3c8a60726920a753ac1746fc3843db6f.poster.avif?t=1789472448\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/3c8a60726920a753ac1746fc3843db6f.webm?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/3c8a60726920a753ac1746fc3843db6f.mp4?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite variety of gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 powerful, unique character classes, 31 type of pets, over a hundred of various spells and items - all combining into an enormous amount of combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/b61dfdbba15ed2211399c9d97f62f831.poster.avif?t=1789472448\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/b61dfdbba15ed2211399c9d97f62f831.webm?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/b61dfdbba15ed2211399c9d97f62f831.mp4?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Constant updates:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years-long history of updates, new mechanics as well as reworks and improvements upon the older ones. Incredible amount of content and ways to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/e9c1ce3dcb7ec6757180778ff56cef8f.poster.avif?t=1789472448\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/e9c1ce3dcb7ec6757180778ff56cef8f.webm?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/e9c1ce3dcb7ec6757180778ff56cef8f.mp4?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully man-made graphics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero AI used, all of the art was done by hand (and with love) from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/68234666d752e45c409a5eb34860a357.poster.avif?t=1789472448\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/68234666d752e45c409a5eb34860a357.webm?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/992070/extras/68234666d752e45c409a5eb34860a357.mp4?t=1789472448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Regular events:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year-round calendar of in-game events as well as various surprises and activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ev